    "body": "### Bug Description\n\nExecute the “Get a DONKI solar flare” node. It returns HTML page from the NASA CCMC Announcements page.\nRoot Cause: NASA migrated the DONKI system backend on the 30th of September [CCMC Announcements | NASA CCMC](https://ccmc.gsfc.nasa.gov/news/major-updates/)\n\nCommunity Link: https://community.n8n.io/t/nasa-node-get-a-donki-solar-flare-returns-html-page-instead-of-json-due-to-nasa-api-migration/319301/3\n\n### To Reproduce\n\nSame steps to https://docs.n8n.io/build-your-first-workflow\nStep 3 of the tutorial does not work \n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNode should call correct endpoint\n\n### Debug Info\n\nn/a\n\n### Operating System\n\nWindows\n\n### n8n Version\n\n2.41.7\n\n### Node.js Version\n\n24\n\n### Database\n\nSQLite (default)\n\n### Execution mode\n\nmain (default)\n\n### Hosting\n\nself hosted",
